# p2-jettison.drv - Phase 2 tour: one unit of cargo jettisoned, seen close.
#
# Verifies: B10 the jettisoned canister (model 184, docs/hd/hulls.md).
# Run:  tools/p2shots --routes jettison --base BASE --branch BRANCH
# Expect: 01 the external view (own ship from behind) about 1.5 s after the
#         jettison, paused: the canister, in its target box, close to the
#         ship; 02 the same view half a second of game time later. Where
#         it flies off to (above, below, in front) varies per run.
# Start 3 (docked), new game; buys one unit from the market's first page.
wait 6000
key space
wait 2000
key 3
wait 11000
